# an option fold in a unit-level definition is checked as a body checks the same
# call: an argument that does not fit its parameter, a member the option does
# not declare, and a StringView constant's piece -- an Option StringView, a
# reftype with no compile-time value -- are each refused.
G: "abc"
SV: "abc".stringView
NEG: G.byteAt (0 - 1)
WIDE: ((G.byteAt 1).or d: 300)
FOO: (G.byteAt 1).foo
PIECE: SV.stripPrefix "a"
main: function is {
    print G
}
